This product includes or depends on the following open-source components:

---

OpenMined PSI
Copyright The OpenMined Contributors
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
Source: https://github.com/OpenMined/PSI
Fork: https://github.com/georgetown-mdi/OpenMinedPSI

The OpenMined PSI module is vendored in this repository at
lib/openmined-psi.js-2.0.6-seclink.3.tgz, built from the fork above. It is a
JavaScript binding for the Google Private Join and Compute library, shipping a
WebAssembly build alongside native N-API prebuilds.

---

Google Private Join and Compute
Copyright Google LLC
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
Source: https://github.com/google/private-join-and-compute

This library is the underlying C++ implementation of the PSI protocol used
by OpenMined PSI.

---

BoringSSL
Copyright The BoringSSL Authors and the OpenSSL Project Authors
Copyright 1995-1998 Eric A. Young, Tim J. Hudson
Licensed under the OpenSSL License, SSLeay License, and ISC License
Source: https://boringssl.googlesource.com/boringssl/

BoringSSL is Google's fork of OpenSSL, embedded in the Google Private Join and
Compute library and compiled into both the OpenMined PSI WebAssembly module and
its native prebuilds. BoringSSL does not use numbered releases; the specific
commit is determined by the OpenMined PSI build configuration. The
openmined-psi.js-2.0.6-seclink.3.tgz package ships no NOTICE file of its own.

This product includes software developed by the OpenSSL Project for use in the
OpenSSL Toolkit (https://www.openssl.org/).

